# AI services routed through the manual `AI` policy (anti-ban: stable exit IP).
# Surge syntax. Supported types: DOMAIN, DOMAIN-SUFFIX, DOMAIN-KEYWORD, IP-CIDR, IP-CIDR6.
# Domain entries build the `ai` set; IP entries build the `ai-ip` set.
# Only add entries from first-party/official sources and cite them in the PR.
#
# No DOMAIN-KEYWORD: keywords hit unrelated domains (e.g. "codex" matches
# codexdna.com, "openai" matches third-party mirror sites) and pin that traffic
# to the manually fixed AI exit. Use DOMAIN / DOMAIN-SUFFIX only.

# Anthropic / Claude
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
# Anthropic inbound IP ranges: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/ip-addresses
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/23
IP-CIDR6,2607:6bc0::/48

# OpenAI / ChatGPT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com

# Google Gemini
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# GitHub Copilot
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com
DOMAIN,copilot.github.com
DOMAIN,copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com

# Perplexity
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai

# xAI / Grok
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com

# Mistral
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mistral.ai

# Cursor
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.sh

# Other account-based AI services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,character.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,elevenlabs.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,midjourney.com
